        "TileImage": "$($repository 01166425-2d56-475c-9dc9-2a871f1e7a7c).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47,\r\rThe ICA has identified the next location of an occult group they refer to as &quot;The Pale Ones.&quot; \rTheir leader? Dennis. A former ICA associate dismissed after descending into cultish extremism.\rWe aren&apos;t certain of Dennis and his four &quot;witches&apos;&quot; intetions for attending the fashion show; only that they are going to continue to gain power and they must be stopped. \rThere is only one condition: \rOnly pure silver will suffice. \r\rGood hunting, Agent 47.\r\r-The ICA\rOffice of Contract Operations",
